cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AISKG, cite this software release, the associated manuscript, BioRED, and BioREDirect where applicable."
title: "AISKG: Ontology-Constrained Biomedical Evidence Extraction and Knowledge Graph Framework"
type: software
version: 3.2.0
date-released: 2026-08-28
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: "Lourembam"
    given-names: "Romen Meitei"
repository-code: "https://github.com/romenmeitei/AISKG"
url: "https://github.com/romenmeitei/AISKG"
keywords:
  - biomedical natural language processing
  - biomedical relation extraction
  - semantic knowledge graph
  - ontology-guided extraction
  - evidence provenance
  - BioRED
  - BioREDirect
  - pathway validation
  - reproducibility
abstract: >-
  AISKG v3.2.0 preserves the deterministic v3.0.0 core and complete v3.1.2
  reviewer/in-domain benchmark replay, and adds an independently executed
  BioRED/BioREDirect external relation-classification benchmark under
  gold-entity conditions, with repository-integrated transfer adapters,
  public-safe frozen results, quality gates and a GPU Colab workflow.
